Use the **nmpa-drugs** skill to query NMPA drug registration information.

## Output Format

```
【药品注册信息】
药品名称：[name]
商品名：[brand_name]
批准文号：[approval_number]
注册分类：[classification]
药品分类：[otc/prescription]
生产企业：[manufacturer]
```
